-- column 25 + k is 1 exactly on class k. Per class, give line i a distinct 2-subset c_i of
-- {0, 1, 2, 3}; rectangle t takes the lines with t in c_i and the points of the lines with
-- t not in c_i, plus the four columns 25 + m with m different from k. Twenty rectangles.
